&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Now Hiring: Licensed Practical Nurses (LPNs) in Minnesota&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Grow your skills while staying close to home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;BAYADA is hiring compassionate LPNs to support 1:1 clients in Princeton and nearby towns. You’ll enjoy flexible shifts, weekly pay, and the opportunity to bring comfort and stability to the people who need it most in your community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;What BAYADA Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
